-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 6, §6.10 מורה מרכז מקצוע
-- The subject coordinator in a post-primary school: when one is appointed,
-- who qualifies, for how long, and the coordination reward's rate and payer.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `6.10 מורה מרכז מקצוע`

@desc A subject as it is taught in one post-primary institution, as far as section 6.10 asks.
DECLARE `subject in a school` HAS
    `is a post-primary institution`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `classes in the school`                    IS A NUMBER
    `weekly hours taught in the subject`       IS A NUMBER
    `other teachers at half a position or more` IS A NUMBER @desc teachers of the subject, besides the coordinator, employed in it at half a position or more
    `other teachers at less than half a position` IS A NUMBER @desc teachers of the subject, besides the coordinator, employed in it at less than half a position
    `is a small school`                        IS A BOOLEAN @desc in the sense of section 6.10.2א's last paragraph, for 6.10.2א.2
    `teachers of the subject`                  IS A NUMBER @desc all who teach the subject, for 6.10.2א.2
    `positions the subject's hours fill`       IS A NUMBER @desc the subject's hours over all its teachers, in full positions, for 6.10.2א.2

@desc The two kinds of subject section 6.10.2ב.1 defines, by what a permanent licence to teach them in the upper division requires.
DECLARE `kind of subject` IS ONE OF
    `theoretical subject`
    `other subject`

@desc A candidate for subject coordinator.
DECLARE `coordinator candidate` HAS
    `holds an academic degree in the subject`         IS A BOOLEAN @desc recognised by the Ministry for a permanent licence in the subject
    `has full pedagogical training`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a permanent licence in the subject`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `licence earned by completion exams or the licensing committee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the permanent licence was granted on all the completion exams, or by the clarification committee for teaching licences
    `supervision finds him the most suitable teacher of the subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc in the pedagogical supervision's opinion, more suitable professionally and pedagogically than every other teacher of the subject in the school
    `years teaching the subject`                      IS A NUMBER
    `has guidance ability in pedagogical work`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `position fraction teaching the subject in the school` IS A NUMBER

@desc The approvals an appointment was given.
DECLARE `coordinator approvals` HAS
    `approved by the school's supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the owner`               IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `6.10 action` IS ONE OF
    `appoint a subject coordinator` HAS `for school years` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the coordination reward`
    `notify the other owner of the payment`

§§ `6.10.2 מינוי`

-- §6.10.2, opening paragraph: coordinators are appointed by the criteria
-- below, "but not fewer than one subject coordinator per institution".
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2/p1
GIVEN `coordinators the criteria give` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `coordinators the institution has` `coordinators the criteria give` IS
    max `coordinators the criteria give` 1

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_a/p1 The heading of §6.10.2א (conditions for appointing a subject coordinator); its two paragraphs are encoded below.

-- §6.10.2א.1's staffing condition: "two more teachers at ½ position, or 3
-- more teachers at less than ½ position". ½ is read as at least ½, as in
-- §6.10.6.2א. The words, as printed, do not decide a mixed staff (F-6.10-b).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a school`, `at half or more` IS A NUMBER, `at less than half` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the staff condition as printed` s `at half or more` `at less than half` IF
       s's `other teachers at half a position or more` AT LEAST `at half or more`
    OR s's `other teachers at less than half a position` AT LEAST `at less than half`

-- The reading adopted (F-6.10-b): a teacher at half a position or more also
-- counts towards the larger number of teachers the second alternative asks
-- for, so more teaching never disqualifies.
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a school`, `at half or more` IS A NUMBER, `at less than half` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the staff condition` s `at half or more` `at less than half` IF
       s's `other teachers at half a position or more` AT LEAST `at half or more`
    OR s's `other teachers at half a position or more` PLUS s's `other teachers at less than half a position` AT LEAST `at less than half`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a school`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal may appoint a coordinator for the subject` s IF
        s's `is a post-primary institution`
    AND s's `classes in the school` AT LEAST 8
    AND s's `weekly hours taught in the subject` AT LEAST 48
    AND `the staff condition` s 2 3

-- §6.10.2א.2: in a small school, or where two or more teach the subject
-- and their hours come to at least one position, the district manager may
-- recommend a coordinator, who receives 4% (rate under §6.10.6.1א).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a school`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the district manager may recommend a coordinator` s IF
       s's `is a small school`
    OR (s's `teachers of the subject` AT LEAST 2 AND s's `positions the subject's hours fill` AT LEAST 1)

-- The cap on §6.10.2א.2's arrangement: 280 teachers in 5754 (תשנ"ד), and
-- no more than 500 in all in 5754 and 5755 (תשנ"ה). No cap, and no end, is
-- stated for any later year (F-6.10-d).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_a/p2
GIVEN `school year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `teachers the arrangement may be approved for` `school year` IS
    BRANCH IF `school year` EQUALS 5754 THEN JUST 280
           IF `school year` EQUALS 5755 THEN JUST 500
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_a/p2
GIVEN `average parallel classes` IS A NUMBER, `entitled under the existing criteria` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a small school for the arrangement` `average parallel classes` `entitled under the existing criteria` IF
    `average parallel classes` AT MOST 2 OR NOT `entitled under the existing criteria`

`the cap is stated for no year after 5755` MEANS
    all (GIVEN y YIELD `teachers the arrangement may be approved for` y EQUALS NOTHING)
        (LIST 5756, 5757, 5760, 5770, 5780)
#ASSERT `the cap is stated for no year after 5755`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b/p1 The heading of §6.10.2ב (the requirements of the post); its paragraphs are encoded below.
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_1/p1 The heading "הגדרות" of the two definitions that follow.

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_1/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_1/p3
GIVEN `a permanent upper-division licence requires a degree in it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `kind of subject`
DECIDE `kind of subject by its licence` `a permanent upper-division licence requires a degree in it` IS
    IF `a permanent upper-division licence requires a degree in it`
    THEN `theoretical subject`
    ELSE `other subject`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_a
GIVEN c IS A `coordinator candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies for a theoretical subject in the ordinary way` c IF
    c's `holds an academic degree in the subject` AND c's `has full pedagogical training`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_b
GIVEN c IS A `coordinator candidate`, `the case is special and exceptional` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies for a theoretical subject by exception` c `the case is special and exceptional` IF
        `the case is special and exceptional`
    AND c's `holds a permanent licence in the subject`
    AND c's `licence earned by completion exams or the licensing committee`
    AND c's `supervision finds him the most suitable teacher of the subject`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN c IS A `coordinator candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies for an other subject` c IF
    c's `holds a permanent licence in the subject`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_4
GIVEN c IS A `coordinator candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the experience requirements` c IF
        c's `years teaching the subject` AT LEAST 3
    AND c's `has guidance ability in pedagogical work`
    AND c's `position fraction teaching the subject in the school` AT LEAST 1/3

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN a IS A `coordinator approvals`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the appointment is approved` a IF
    a's `approved by the school's supervisor` AND a's `approved by the owner`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_4
GIVEN k IS A `kind of subject`, c IS A `coordinator candidate`, `the case is special and exceptional` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be appointed subject coordinator` k c `the case is special and exceptional` IF
        `meets the experience requirements` c
    AND CONSIDER k
        WHEN `theoretical subject` THEN    `qualifies for a theoretical subject in the ordinary way` c
                                        OR `qualifies for a theoretical subject by exception` c `the case is special and exceptional`
        WHEN `other subject`       THEN `qualifies for an other subject` c

-- §6.10.2ב.5: for one school year only, made at the start of each year by
-- the institution's management with the supervisor's and owner's approval.
-- Time in school months; the appointment is made by month 1 (September).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_a__subpara_1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_b__subpara_5
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a school`, k IS A `kind of subject`, c IS A `coordinator candidate`, a IS A `coordinator approvals`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `6.10 action`
DECIDE `appointing a subject coordinator` s k c a IS
    IF     `the principal may appoint a coordinator for the subject` s
       AND `may be appointed subject coordinator` k c FALSE
       AND `the appointment is approved` a
    THEN PARTY `the school principal`
         MAY   `appoint a subject coordinator` years PROVIDED years EQUALS 1
         WITHIN 1
    ELSE PARTY `the school principal`
         SHANT `appoint a subject coordinator` years
         LEST  BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 6.10.2: the subject, the candidate or the approvals do not meet the conditions"

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2/p3 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2/p4 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2/p5 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2/p6 The sources (אסמכתא) of section 6.10.2.

§§ `6.10.6 גמול ריכוז מקצוע`

-- §6.10.6.2א–ג: three rates, each with its own hours and staff. Each
-- higher rate's conditions include the lower's, and the highest met governs.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_2__subpara_a akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_2__subpara_b akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_2__subpara_c
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a school`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `coordination rate by the subject's size` s IS
    BRANCH
        IF s's `is a post-primary institution` AND s's `weekly hours taught in the subject` AT LEAST 100 AND `the staff condition` s 5 6
        THEN JUST (7%)
        IF s's `is a post-primary institution` AND s's `weekly hours taught in the subject` AT LEAST 72 AND `the staff condition` s 4 5
        THEN JUST (6%)
        IF s's `is a post-primary institution` AND s's `weekly hours taught in the subject` AT LEAST 48 AND `the staff condition` s 2 3
        THEN JUST (5%)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- §6.10.6.1א's second paragraph ("1א"): a coordinator appointed under
-- §6.10.2א.2 receives 4%.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_1__subpara_b/p2
GIVEN s IS A `subject in a school`, `appointed under 6.10.2א.2` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `coordination rate` s `appointed under 6.10.2א.2` IS
    CONSIDER `coordination rate by the subject's size` s
    WHEN JUST r THEN JUST r
    WHEN NOTHING THEN IF `appointed under 6.10.2א.2` THEN JUST (4%) ELSE NOTHING

-- F-6.10-a: §6.10.2 requires at least one coordinator in every
-- post-primary institution, but a coordinator appointed to meet that floor
-- in a school that meets neither §6.10.6.2 nor §6.10.2א.2 has no rate.
`a 6-class school, 20 hours, two teachers at a third` MEANS
    `subject in a school` WITH
        `is a post-primary institution`               IS TRUE
        `classes in the school`                       IS 6
        `weekly hours taught in the subject`          IS 20
        `other teachers at half a position or more`   IS 0
        `other teachers at less than half a position` IS 1
        `is a small school`                           IS FALSE
        `teachers of the subject`                     IS 2
        `positions the subject's hours fill`          IS 20/24

`the floor's coordinator has no rate` MEANS
        `coordinators the institution has` 0 EQUALS 1
    AND `coordination rate` `a 6-class school, 20 hours, two teachers at a third` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
    AND NOT `the district manager may recommend a coordinator` `a 6-class school, 20 hours, two teachers at a third`
#ASSERT `the floor's coordinator has no rate`

-- F-6.10-b: as printed, 48 hours with three other teachers, one of them at
-- half a position or more, meets neither alternative — though three at
-- less than half do.
`48 hours, one other at half and two at less` MEANS
    `subject in a school` WITH
        `is a post-primary institution`               IS TRUE
        `classes in the school`                       IS 12
        `weekly hours taught in the subject`          IS 48
        `other teachers at half a position or more`   IS 1
        `other teachers at less than half a position` IS 2
        `is a small school`                           IS FALSE
        `teachers of the subject`                     IS 4
        `positions the subject's hours fill`          IS 2

`48 hours, three others at less than half` MEANS
    `subject in a school` WITH
        `is a post-primary institution`               IS TRUE
        `classes in the school`                       IS 12
        `weekly hours taught in the subject`          IS 48
        `other teachers at half a position or more`   IS 0
        `other teachers at less than half a position` IS 3
        `is a small school`                           IS FALSE
        `teachers of the subject`                     IS 4
        `positions the subject's hours fill`          IS 2

`a mixed staff meets neither alternative as printed` MEANS
        (NOT `the staff condition as printed` `48 hours, one other at half and two at less` 2 3)
    AND `the staff condition as printed` `48 hours, three others at less than half` 2 3
#ASSERT `a mixed staff meets neither alternative as printed`

-- §6.10.6.1א: from 1.11.83 the reward is a percentage of the coordinator's
-- combined salary (משכורת משולבת) by grade and seniority. §6.10.2א.2 says
-- its 4% is "משכרו המשולם" — of the salary paid him (F-6.10-c).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER, `combined salary by grade and seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `coordination reward` rate `combined salary by grade and seniority` IS
    rate TIMES `combined salary by grade and seniority`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_2__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN `salary paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 4% reward as §6.10.2א.2 words it` `salary paid` IS
    4% TIMES `salary paid`

`§6.10.2א.2 and §6.10.6.1א price the 4% on different salaries` MEANS
    NOT (`the 4% reward as §6.10.2א.2 words it` 6000 EQUALS `coordination reward` (4%) 10000)
#ASSERT `§6.10.2א.2 and §6.10.6.1א price the 4% on different salaries`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_1__subpara_b
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reward counts as salary for cost-of-living, severance and pension` IF FALSE

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_2__subpara_d
GIVEN `still fills the post` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reward is paid` `still fills the post` IF `still fills the post`

-- §6.10.6.3: a six-year school is one institution, so a teacher of the
-- subject in both divisions counts as teaching in one; where two owners pay
-- his salary, the owner in whose division most of the subject's hours are
-- taught pays the reward. Equal hours have no majority (F-6.10-e).
DECLARE `paying owner` IS ONE OF `the middle division's owner`, `the upper division's owner`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_3
GIVEN `hours in the middle division` IS A NUMBER, `hours in the upper division` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours counted for the reward` `hours in the middle division` `hours in the upper division` IS
    `hours in the middle division` PLUS `hours in the upper division`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_3
GIVEN `hours in the middle division` IS A NUMBER, `hours in the upper division` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `paying owner`
DECIDE `who pays the reward` `hours in the middle division` `hours in the upper division` IS
    BRANCH IF `hours in the middle division` GREATER THAN `hours in the upper division`
           THEN JUST `the middle division's owner`
           IF `hours in the upper division` GREATER THAN `hours in the middle division`
           THEN JUST `the upper division's owner`
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

`equal hours name no paying owner` MEANS `who pays the reward` 10 10 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `equal hours name no paying owner`

-- The paying owner notifies the other, so that it pays nothing. No time is
-- set; the school month of payment is read as the deadline.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_3/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `6.10 action`
DECIDE `paying and notifying` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the coordination reward`
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
           MUST  `notify the other owner of the payment`
           WITHIN 1)

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6__para_3/p3 A pointer to section 1.12 of the takanon, encoded there.

-- Examples (placeholder schools and salaries).
`100 hours, five others at half` MEANS
    `subject in a school` WITH
        `is a post-primary institution`               IS TRUE
        `classes in the school`                       IS 30
        `weekly hours taught in the subject`          IS 100
        `other teachers at half a position or more`   IS 5
        `other teachers at less than half a position` IS 0
        `is a small school`                           IS FALSE
        `teachers of the subject`                     IS 6
        `positions the subject's hours fill`          IS 4

#ASSERT `coordination rate` `100 hours, five others at half` FALSE EQUALS JUST (7%)
#ASSERT `coordination rate` `48 hours, one other at half and two at less` FALSE EQUALS JUST (5%)
#ASSERT `coordination reward` (7%) 10000 EQUALS 700
#ASSERT `who pays the reward` 4 8 EQUALS JUST `the upper division's owner`

#TRACE `paying and notifying` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the coordination reward` AT 1
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `notify the other owner of the payment` AT 1

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p3 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p4 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p5 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p6 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p7 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p8 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p9 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p10 akn:chp_6__sec_6_10__ssec_6_10_6/p11 The sources (אסמכתא) of section 6.10.6.
